      "name": "Tin Valley",
      "kind": "region",
      "facts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "The danger here is an orc nest in the cut, reached from the market square: orcs raid the valley road and hoard stolen goods. No other monsters (no harpies, wolf-men or dragons) are known here."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "The Miners Guild, under its steward Osric Vane, wants the nest gone so the Guild can take the hill. Osric is Guild, not orc."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Coin: 1 gold = 50 silver = 500 copper; 10 copper = 1 silver."
        }
      ]
    },
